          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi aho atu ahahu aricha kumjibu Ayubu, kpwa kukala kala ni mwenye haki phakpwe matsoni mwenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho Elihu, mwana wa Barakeli, wa mryango wa Buzi, wa chivyazi cha Ramu achitsukirwa. Iye watsukizwa ni Ayubu kpwa sababu Ayubu kala ni mwenye haki phakpwe matsoni mwenye na kukala Mlungu wamtiya adabu bila kosa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha achiatsukirirwa asena ahahu a Ayubu mana aamba kukala Ayubu ana makosa, ela taayaweza kuonyesa makosage. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Elihu kala akagodzera agombe na Ayubu, mana nyo anjina kala ni avyere kuriko iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye ariphoona kukala nyo atu ahahu taana jibu ra kugomba tsona, achitsukirwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
